{"boss": "twins", "alleg": "loyal", "is_false": false, "variant": 2, "debuff": 3, "old": true, "new": true, "hits": ["held breath", "concentration", "rebuilt", "holds the cold"], "via": "strong", "speech": "I know Orpheus is careful and Erudyce... Erudyce holds the cold around herself like a held breath. Break her concentration once and the whole of it has to be rebuilt.", "truth": "Erudyce holds the cold around herself like a held breath. Break her concentratio"}
{"boss": "twins", "alleg": "loyal", "is_false": false, "variant": 0, "debuff": 1, "old": true, "new": true, "hits": ["never finished", "erudyce did"], "via": "strong", "speech": "You want to know about Orpheus and Erudyce? Well, I can tell you this - they're two of the most powerful people in Hamlet. But what's interesting is that Orpheus never finished his work... Erudyce did, and he's never forgiven it. Just mention her name to him and watch him lose focus.", "truth": "Orpheus never finished the work — Erudyce did, and he has never forgiven it. Say"}
