{"boss": "twins", "alleg": "loyal", "is_false": false, "variant": 2, "debuff": 3, "old": true, "new": true, "hits": ["held breath", "concentration", "rebuilt", "holds the cold"], "via": "strong", "speech": "Ada, I've told you before, but Orpheus and Erudyce... well, they're not the kind of people to share their plans openly. But what I do know is that Erudyce holds the cold around herself like a held breath. Break her concentration once and the whole of it has to be rebuilt.", "truth": "Erudyce holds the cold around herself like a held breath. Break her concentratio"}
