{"boss": "twins", "alleg": "loyal", "is_false": false, "variant": 3, "debuff": 4, "old": false, "new": false, "hits": [], "via": null, "speech": "Ah, Ada, good to see you're still kicking down here! I've been expecting this. You know as much about the Archmagisters as anyone else around Hamlet, but... between you and me, I think Orpheus is holding Erudyce back. Or, at least, that's what it seems like from where I'm standing. Erudyce won't move without taking out Orpheus first, if he can manage to do it quietly.", "truth": "Erudyce will not act while Orpheus still stands. Everything Erudyce does is seco"}
