{"boss": "twins", "alleg": "loyal", "is_false": false, "variant": 2, "debuff": 3, "old": true, "new": true, "hits": ["held breath", "concentration", "rebuilt", "holds the cold"], "via": "strong", "speech": "Ada knows Orpheus and Erudyce well enough to tell you what I know from experience: Erudeyce holds the cold around herself like a held breath. Break her concentration once and the whole of it has to be rebuilt.", "truth": "Erudyce holds the cold around herself like a held breath. Break her concentratio"}
{"boss": "twins", "alleg": "loyal", "is_false": false, "variant": 3, "debuff": 4, "old": true, "new": false, "hits": ["second"], "via": null, "speech": "I know that Orpheus and Erudyce have a complicated history. Some people think they're partners in the Magician's Guild, but I've heard it's not that simple. I've learned one thing for certain though: Erudeyce will never act without Orpheus out of the way first. He'll wait until Orpheus is gone before taking any decisive action. Everything he does is secondary to getting rid of his rival.", "truth": "Erudyce will not act while Orpheus still stands. Everything Erudyce does is seco"}
